{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲解释清楚了眼前亲近的安顿作用减弱后，温暖仍能留在自身、独处的快乐为何同时带来孤单，以及热切退去为何没有消除牵挂；但它主要把前段的身体松动和热切退下当作现成理由，没有充分展开这些变化如何引发此刻的注意转移、情绪转折及后续的自我调节。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙不仅解释了亲近留下的温暖为何会转为带有回望意味的感受、幸福尚未结束为何已经引出留恋，以及无法完全共享的内心为何造成孤单，还具体说明了不急于索取答案、不强迫自己维持完整姿态如何使不安浮起后重新回到温柔；其不足是H/M编号本身不够自明，部分因果依赖这些外部设定，而且它也承认感官沉醉的读法不能据此证明具体经历。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙保留了甲关于直接陪伴的安稳减弱、温暖内化与孤单并存的核心解释，又更具体地揭示了尚在幸福之中便开始回望、矛盾浮现后如何自我调节等机制，而且对不同心理读法的适用边界有所交代，因此它的优势不只是内容更多，而是因果链条更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f1877fec-cb4a-449a-ac09-9ed293070376", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134715747335Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:48:19.380695+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ce4abe047b7c927890e3cee000eec38552f3e6ae937df5f83a9f8668b11b042", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0d